his tomb; and the house of Simon the leper, of Mary Magdalene and of Martha, and the identical tree which our Lord cursed, are among the monkish curiosities of the place.</p>\n<p>Mr 11:11,19; Lu 10:38; Joh 11:1,18; 12:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-21-18","title":"Matthew 21:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>in. Mr 11:12,13 he hungered. 4:2; 12:1; Lu 4:2; Heb 4:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-21-19","title":"Matthew 21:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>fig-tree. Gr. one fig-tree. and found Isa 5:4,5; Lu 3:9; 13:6-9; Joh 15:2,6; 2Ti 3:5; Tit 1:16 Let. Mr 11:14; Lu 19:42-44; Heb 6:7,8; 2Pe 2:20-22; Re 22:11 the fig-tree. Jude 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-21-20","title":"Matthew 21:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>How. Isa 40:6-8; Mr 11:20,21; Jas 1:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-21-21","title":"Matthew 21:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>If ye have. 17:20; Mr 11:22,23; Lu 17:6,7; Ro 4:19,20; 1Co 13:2; Jas 1:6 Be thou removed. 8:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-21-22","title":"Matthew 21:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>7:7,11; 18:19; Mr 11:24; Lu 11:8-10; Joh 14:13; 15:7; 16:24; Jas 5:16 1Jo 3:22; 5:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-21-23","title":"Matthew 21:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>when. Mr 11:27,28; Lu 19:47,48; 20:1,2 the chief priests. 1Ch 24:1-19 By what. Ex 2:14; Ac 4:7; 7:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-21-24","title":"Matthew 21:24","author":"R. A. Torrey 